{
  "label": "mollycafe20",
  "title_zh": "",
  "lines": [
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "label mollycafe20:",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene seconddnd1",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/seconddnd1.webp",
      "alt": "seconddnd1"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I swing open the door to the cafe and quickly stumble onto the fact that tonight will be exponentially louder than I expected.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "And considering I came here to see Molly, the expectation for noise was already pretty high.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Is it really okay for them to be playing this in the cafe, though? I can’t imagine Haruka signed off on this.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Ohoho~ It appears we have ourselves a new player!",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Take a seat, Sir! I shall help you create a character!",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Uhh, no. I’m good.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I didn’t realize you all had plans to play here tonight.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": But I literally texted you about this exact thing happening.",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yes, but I stopped reading the second I saw words I didn’t understand.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene seconddnd2",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/seconddnd2.webp",
      "alt": "seconddnd2"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What if what I had to say was important?!",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What if I was being kidnapped and didn’t have time to think of words you like?!",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Then you’d probably be in someone’s trunk right now.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Are you sure you don’t want to play, Sir? We could use someone with your alignment.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": My...what?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Neutral evil, Sir. That’s how I see your character.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Evil? Absolutely not.",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Sensei is lawful good. He’d never do anything to hurt anyone and always stands up for what is right.",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene seconddnd3",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/seconddnd3.webp",
      "alt": "seconddnd3"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I don’t think he’s lawful good but maybe...neutral good?",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": His intentions aren’t always clear but I don’t think he’s a bad guy.",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Ayane! Stop saying you’re in love with my [uncle]!",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": How do you see yourself, Sensei?",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I don’t even know what you’re talking about.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That’s okay...neither did Tsuneyo and...we helped her figure it out.",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Tsuneyo? Is she here?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Behind you.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene seconddnd4",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/seconddnd4.webp",
      "alt": "seconddnd4"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": My alignment is noodle evil.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Neutral evil, Kendo Princess.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Noodle evil.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Do you understand what they’re talking about?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Almost. I seem to have everything very slightly wrong.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That adds up.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": She’ll be able to play once she starts following the rules.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": She’s right. I am very bad at this game.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well, I guess the two of us can watch together as long as you don’t get drunk and pass out on me again.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I will do my very best.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene seconddnd5",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/seconddnd5.webp",
      "alt": "seconddnd5"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": If anyone wants my input, I think Sensei is chaotic evil. The absolute worst kind of person.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": And I think you’re a nerd.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene seconddnd6",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/seconddnd6.webp",
      "alt": "seconddnd6"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Why does everyone keep calling me a nerd?!",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Ooooh, a critical hit!",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m giving Sensei advantage on his next attack as a special bonus for getting Maya to yell.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene seconddnd7",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/seconddnd7.webp",
      "alt": "seconddnd7"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Tch!",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It’s okay, Maya. I don’t think you’re a nerd.",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": But I do want you to know that a certain rogue might sneak into your room at night and assassinate you for calling her true love evil.",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": So...you watched the game on the beach...right, Sensei?",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": The one I wasn’t around for.",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I tried to. All I remember is a mushroom.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well, never fear, Sir! For I shall be giving a recap of our exploits thus far shortly!",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": We’ve played...a few more times since then and...you’ve missed a lot.",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Sana had her arm chopped off.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": And then I...beat a man to death with it...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yeah, Sana doesn’t really mess around when it comes to D&D.",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Okay, well I’m going to sit down now.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene seconddnd8",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/seconddnd8.webp",
      "alt": "seconddnd8"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": They never chose an alignment for you.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Allow me to do it instead.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I declare you...",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": True noodle.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I declare you weird.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I declare my feelings hurt.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Please never talk to me again.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Can I treat you to ramen to win you back?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene seconddnd9",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/seconddnd9.webp",
      "alt": "seconddnd9"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I will not allow myself to be bought off like this.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene seconddnd10",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/seconddnd10.webp",
      "alt": "seconddnd10"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Okay! That’s enough idle chit chat! The time has come for our journey to continue!",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": We only have two hours until the Magistrate of Mammaries returns to the cafe and scolds all of us for taking up an entire section of the store without buying anything!",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m a big fan of the nickname you chose for Haruka. It's very fitting.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Don’t you think it would be a little better for Futaba, though? I think hers are bigger.",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Futaba, what size bra do you wear? Like X?",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I...don’t think it goes that high...",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Enough!",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene seconddnd11",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/seconddnd11.webp",
      "alt": "seconddnd11"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": When we last left off, we discovered that a powerful Illithid by the name of Thaum had emerged from the Underdark with a small army of thralls at their disposal.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": The party, sensing it had to unite or face a rather untimely and premature level two demise, banded together to force back the thralls.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene seconddnd12",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/seconddnd12.webp",
      "alt": "seconddnd12"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": But not before the loss of Zagull Throat Spear’s arm.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Without anyone able to help Zagull regenerate said arm and Thaum retreating to do more evil psion stuff...",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": The party headed to the nearby city of Frostford for some much needed rest and...hopefully an experienced healer.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene seconddnd13",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/seconddnd13.webp",
      "alt": "seconddnd13"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Despite its name, Frostford is a coastal, port city that is home to one of the biggest alchemical colleges in all of the land.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": So it’s no surprise when you see the streets lined with [young]alchemists, their noses buried deep in books, studying their hearts out to prepare for upcoming exams.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It’s the end of a semester and the city is bustling with uncertainty and energy.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": The perfect time to talk to anyone you want or, better yet, ask them anything you’re still curious about.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Your party still has no clear goal as you took a wrong turn and ran into Thaum long before you were supposed to, so things could really go anywhere from here.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene seconddnd14",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/seconddnd14.webp",
      "alt": "seconddnd14"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": So, what do you guys wanna do?",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Like I said, there’s no goal right now and you still don’t know why you all woke up next to one another, so it’s probably a good idea to go out and find a...reason to exist or something.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene seconddnd15",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/seconddnd15.webp",
      "alt": "seconddnd15"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Sana, how important is it for you to get your arm back?",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I kind of like only having one arm...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It makes me look strong and...I’m able to wield my greataxe with one hand.",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You’ll still have disadvantage though, so...just saying.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Okay, but what matters more to you? Looking cool or killing people?",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That’s...umm...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Actually, don’t let Sana think about that. What would Zagull want?",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene seconddnd16",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/seconddnd16.webp",
      "alt": "seconddnd16"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Zagull will...bathe in the blood of his enemies no matter the circumstances!",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": He only needs one arm to drain the life from his opponents!",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene seconddnd17",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/seconddnd17.webp",
      "alt": "seconddnd17"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well...while Nithhala and Zagull are trying to figure out the arm thing, do you think maybe the rest of us should head to a tavern or something?",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Is your wizard also an alcoholic?",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene seconddnd18",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/seconddnd18.webp",
      "alt": "seconddnd18"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What? No. Just...that’s where you normally go to pick up quests and stuff.",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That’s true. Innkeepers always seem to know the latest gossip in fantasy novels.",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene seconddnd14",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/seconddnd14.webp",
      "alt": "seconddnd14"
    },
    {
