      "en": ": Do you...not even want to try?",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": There are plenty of things I never expected to like that I absolutely love now...And I never would have known that if I didn’t give them a chance.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Granted, they’re all different doujinshi tags and that doesn’t really apply to this conversation, but I’m sure you know what I mean.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I don’t. Please explain.",
