      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yes, Emerald Guardian. I understand.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Maybe some other time. I’m just going to head out now, though.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": As for Tsuneyo-",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": She’ll be fine.",
